## Career and Business Guidance

Astrology helps identify professional tendencies and suitable career directions. For entrepreneurs, it may guide on auspicious dates for ventures, agreements, or launches. Practical factors like qualifications and market conditions should also be considered.

## Marriage Compatibility

Kundli matching is used to assess compatibility through planetary positions, Nakshatras, Guna Milan, and Manglik considerations. While helpful, successful marriage also depends on communication, respect, and shared values.

## Planetary Periods and Transits

Vimshottari Dasha and planetary transits (Saturn, Jupiter, Rahu, Ketu) are studied to understand life phases. Each period reflects different experiences based on ruling planets and their chart positions.

## Remedies in Vedic Astrology

Traditional remedies may include mantra chanting, meditation, charity, fasting, temple worship, or gemstones. These practices encourage positivity and discipline but should not replace professional medical, legal, or financial advice.

## Importance of Personalized Astrology

General zodiac predictions are broad. Personalized consultations consider exact birth details, offering specific insights into career, marriage, finances, and spiritual growth. A responsible astrologer explains concepts clearly without creating fear.

